  "title": "Banana Muffins with Sour Cream",
  "description": "This is a great banana muffin with sour cream recipe! It has little sugar and almost no fat if you use fat-free sour cream. A big hit with everyone!",
  "authors": [
    "MEVERTSE"
  ],
